      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Image to UGC video\n\n1. Load your **product photo** and describe the product in **Product brief**.\n2. **BytePlus LLM** looks at the photo and writes a one-line script and a handheld, selfie-style shot prompt.\n3. **Seedance 2.5 Reference** shoots a 9:16 creator video with your product as the reference image.\n4. **Seed TTS** reads the script as a voiceover and the core video nodes put it on the clip.\n\nChange the voice in *Voiceover*, the length in *Creator video* (8 s default). Needs a ModelArk key and a Seed Speech key in Settings > BytePlus."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
